Matam Hussain Ka<br>
<br>

Buniyad lailaha ki Matam Hussain ka<br>
Tauheed ka payam hai ye gham hussain ka..<br>
<br>
Zikre khuda Baland hai abhi Hussain se<br>
Aawaz hai aazan ki baqi Hussain se<br>
Har zikr E haq mein zikar hai paiham Hussain ka<br>
<br>
Sajide mein taige zulm se kat ta hai sheh ka sar<br>
Shukare khud magar hai musal sal zaban par<br>
Kya bandagi E haq mein hai aalam Hussain ka<br>
<br>
Takra k taqatien ye sabhi haar jainge <br>
Koi bulandia ho usse choo na payangi<br>
Uncha rahega qalq mein parcham Hussain ka <br>
<br>
Karbobala se door rahe ga agar Bashar <br>
Reh reh k zulm o jaor uthate rehege sar<br>
Duniya ko saath chahiye har dam Hussain ka<br>
<br>
Sadiyo ke aainey ise dhundla na karsake <br>
Duniya ki aandhiyo mein b jalte rahe diye<br>
Hoga na dil se gham ye kabhi kam Hussain ka<br>
<br>
Zibhe azeem haq ki baqa ka hai mareka<br>
Nabiyo ki mehnato ka khulasa hai karbala<br>
Lete hai naam aadam o khatam hussain ka<br>
<br>
Har ek nabi ko haq ne kiya is se aashna<br>
Karbobala K gham mein bohot roye Mustafa<br>
Is waste ye gham hai muazzam hussain ka<br>
<br>
Mehmaam hai aaj Arsh nashi is zameen pr<br>
Matam kada bana hai har ek matami ka ghar<br>
Aaya hai shaher e gham mein Moharram Hussain ka<br>
<br>
Farhan Gham mein doob k nouha zara suna <br>
Sadiq duae dati hai hum sab ko fatima <br>
Rote hai le k naam agar hum hussain ka<br>
